dated_at":"2025-02-18T09:21:10Z","closed_at":"2025-02-18T09:21:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4 beta 4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta4 - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sun, 09 Feb 2025 16:28:00 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (nvidia; 570.86.16) - AMD Ryzen 9 9900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWorking on a set of WebXR applications right now. We have one godot export that is very small and loads quickly, this dynamically loads PCK files for applications when the user selects to do so. This all works, but specifically in the web build the progress bar is broken (as it is based on get_body_size() and get_downloaded_bytes() which return -1 and 0 respectively on the web export)\n\nLuckily this doesn't break the entire app loading, just the progress bar, but for larger files this is an issue. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\ncreate a HTTPRequest node and call get_body_size() or  get_downloaded_bytes()  from a script in a web export, notice that they don't return actual values.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[http-request.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18838715/http-request.zip)\nyou must host this with Access-Control-Allow-Origin headers to be able to have the file download work correctly. Apologies for how hard that is to set up in advance haha. ","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102981/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102981/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}